>> title: Mushroom and Barley Soup
>> servings: 4
>> tags: lunch, soup, vegetarian
>> time: 50 minutes

Fry @mushrooms{500%g}, sliced, in @butter{30%g} in a #saucepan{} over high heat for ~{8%minutes}.

Add @onion{1}, @carrot{1} and @celery{1%stick}, diced, and cook for ~{8%minutes}.

Stir in @pearl barley{150%g}, @thyme{2%sprigs} and @vegetable stock{1.2%l}.

Simmer for ~{30%minutes}, then season with @salt{1%tsp} and finish with @parsley{2%tbsp}.
